 over high-loss and random deletion 0.002381968563475412 and 0.00781942656942657. Sources: final.metric.combined_score, final.metric.disagreement_baseline_score, final.metric.random_baseline_score, final.metric.paired_gain_vs_disagreement, final.metric.paired_gain_vs_random.\",\n  \"Display every unique stored conditional group-bootstrap gain. Each dataset has 32 records, repeated identically across five episode exports, not 160 independent records. All stored high-loss-relative gains are negative in Arena and positive in NBA; Arena random-relative gains include negative observations. Source: final.evidence.episodes.\",\n  \"Separate seed-resampling intervals from group-weight resampling. The high-loss-relative seed interval has equal endpoints because that contrast is deterministic across recorded seeds; it is not certainty about data variation or general superiority.\",\n  \"Use normalized original-leader rank drop 0.03305066318764949 only as a secondary aggregate for the studied selector, grounded in final.metric.mean_leader_rank_drop. Per-budget curves are normalized inversions, not leader drops or minimal reversal budgets.\",\n  \"A small descriptive search table may show raw scores only: clean-Hessian-only selection 0.013240276724865765 (result.top_program_03), bounded exact refits 0.01595532053579999 (result.top_program_01), retained-curvature expansion 0.01595532053579999 (result.top_program_02). Keep this separate from final results; no campaign winner, derived search-delta, or scored/unscored count claims without study.* grounding.\"\n]\nSUPP {\n  \"purpose\": \"Provide implementation, provenance, numerical-control, and uncertainty depth needed to reproduce and audit the narrow claim, without moving the decisive contrasts or limitations out of the main paper.\",\n  \"planned_subsections\": [\n    {\n      \"heading\": \"Retained-mean objective and frozen-prefix selection\",\n      \"grounded_content\": \"Expand centered ridge Bradley\\u2013Terry, half-win ties, clean contrast/influence solves, retained-mean displacement correction, deterministic tie rules, six-contender selection, pair-statistic compression, warm starts/cache, convergence tolerances, incomplete-refit fallback, and selector/evaluation metric mismatch. Inspected program.py, IMPLEMENTATION.md, and evaluator explain the mechanism, not unreported internal shortlist decisions.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"final.evidence.episodes\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"heading\": \"Data partitioning and reproducibility record\",\n      \"grounded_content\": \"Record pinned Arena/NBA sources, content-group split, largest connected components, NBA copy filtering and historical team-code limitations, source/payload hashes, declared seeds, CPU dependencies and staged-resource commands from inspected manifests/code. Distinguish protocol metadata from measured findings. A complete raw-to-partition builder and all original raw archives are not staged; do not claim otherwise.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"final.evidence.episodes\",\n        \"final.qualification.status\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"heading\": \"Numerical and row-order checks\",\n      \"grounded_content\": \"Explain residual tolerances, no-deletion zero disruption, invalid constant-certificate rejection, reversed-row invariance, and unverified candidate-authored diagnostics. Preserve the exact final qualification outcome without inferring undocumented gate causes or generalization.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"final.evidence.episodes\",\n        \"final.qualification.status\",\n        \"final.qualification.outcome\",\n        \"final.qualification.correct\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"heading\": \"Descriptive search configurations\",\n      \"grounded_content\": \"Archive raw scores and inspected implementations for clean-Hessian selection, bounded exact refits and retained-curvature expansion. State missing final controlled ablations and selection-adjusted uncertainty. A tied aggregate is not identical behavior or an overhead measurement. Do not report campaign counts, unscored losses, derived search deltas, or original-starter performance without study.* sources.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"result.top_program_01\",\n        \"result.top_program_02\",\n        \"result.top_program_03\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"heading\": \"Conditional uncertainty protocol and stored records\",\n      \"grounded_content\": \"Give the complete unique group-weight records and bootstrap algorithm; masks are fixed, weighted removed mass varies, and selection is not rerun. Contrast this with aggregate seed-resampling intervals and their deterministic degeneracy. The main text retains opposite high-loss-relative signs and the conditioning limitations.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"final.evidence.episodes\",\n        \"final.metric.paired_gain_disagreement_ci_low\",\n        \"final.metric.paired_gain_disagreement_ci_high\",\n        \"final.metric.paired_gain_random_ci_low\",\n        \"final.metric.paired_gain_random_ci_high\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
